cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
title: stlextractor
abstract: >-
  MATLAB package to process a large STL file containing a packing of
  hexagonal prisms and extract each prism's geometric parameters (radius,
  axis, volume, etc.).
